---

import Layout from "../layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="services-title">
      <div class="page-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Bay Area Business &amp; Real Estate Attorney</p>
        <h1 id="services-title">Practice Areas</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Modern legal guidance for every stage of your business, portfolio,
          and project.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-band" aria-label="Practice area details">
      <div class="service-rows">
        <article class="service-row" id="financing">
          <figure>
            <img
              src="/practice-financing.png"
              alt="Glass office buildings beside a landscaped courtyard"
              width="1584"
              height="672"
            />
          </figure>
          <div>
            <h2>Real Estate Financing</h2>
            <p>
              We advise on debt and equity structures, loan documentation, and
              closing requirements for commercial and residential projects.
            </p>
            <p>
              That includes lender and borrower review, intercreditor issues,
              and the conditions that have to be true before money moves.
            </p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/contact"
              >Discuss this matter
              <img
                src="/arrow-right-dark.svg"
                alt=""
                width="16"
                height="16"
            /></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service-row" id="acquisitions">
          <figure>
            <img
              src="/practice-acquisitions.png"
              alt="Two professionals shaking hands in an office"
              width="1584"
              height="672"
            />
          </figure>
          <div>
            <h2>Business Acquisitions and Dispositions</h2>
            <p>
              Navigate mergers, acquisitions, and divestitures with counsel on
              due diligence, negotiation, and closing strategy.
            </p>
            <p>
              We help owners sort what is actually being sold, what stays
              behind, and how the purchase agreement should handle both.
            </p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/contact"
              >Discuss this matter
              <img
                src="/arrow-right-dark.svg"
                alt=""
                width="16"
                height="16"
            /></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service-row" id="entity">
          <figure>
            <img
              src="/practice-entity.png"
              alt="Downtown street lined with high-rise buildings"
              width="1584"
              height="672"
            />
          </figure>
          <div>
            <h2>Entity Formation and Structuring</h2>
            <p>
              Build the right foundation with guidance on entity selection,
              governance, ownership, and operational structuring.
            </p>
            <p>
              The goal is a structure that matches how the business is
              actually run, including who decides, who owns, and who signs.
            </p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/contact"
              >Discuss this matter
              <img
                src="/arrow-right-dark.svg"
                alt=""
                width="16"
                height="16"
            /></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service-row" id="construction">
          <figure>
            <img
              src="/practice-construction.png"
              alt="Construction crew working on a concrete building frame"
              width="1584"
              height="672"
            />
          </figure>
          <div>
            <h2>Construction Law</h2>
            <p>
              Manage contracts, disputes, and project delivery with counsel
              tailored to owners, developers, and contractors.
            </p>
            <p>
              We work through contract forms, change orders, and payment
              disputes before a project schedule gets away from the parties.
            </p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/contact"
              >Discuss this matter
              <img
                src="/arrow-right-dark.svg"
                alt=""
                width="16"
                height="16"
            /></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service-row" id="purchase">
          <figure>
            <img
              src="/practice-purchase.png"
              alt="Modern single-story house with a landscaped yard"
              width="1584"
              height="672"
            />
          </figure>
          <div>
            <h2>Real Estate Purchase and Sales</h2>
            <p>
              Close residential and commercial transactions with confidence
              through title review, negotiation, and closing support.
            </p>
            <p>
              From the first offer through recording, the focus is on what the
              documents say and what still has to happen to close.
            </p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/contact"
              >Discuss this matter
              <img
                src="/arrow-right-dark.svg"
                alt=""
                width="16"
                height="16"
            /></a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="service-row" id="leasing">
          <figure>
            <img
              src="/practice-leasing.png"
              alt="Empty modern office with glass-walled meeting rooms"
              width="1584"
              height="672"
            />
          </figure>
          <div>
            <h2>Commercial Leasing</h2>
            <p>
              Protect your interests whether you are leasing, subleasing, or
              negotiating renewal terms for office, retail, or industrial
              space.
            </p>
            <p>
              We look at term, use, assignment, and the costs that show up
              after the rent number is agreed.
            </p>
            <a class="text-link" href="/contact"
              >Discuss this matter
              <img
                src="/arrow-right-dark.svg"
                alt=""
                width="16"
                height="16"
            /></a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-band">
      <svg class="grain" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect width="100%" height="100%" filter="url(#grain)" />
      </svg>
      <div class="cta-band-inner">
        <h2>Not sure which area fits?</h2>
        <p>
          Describe the transaction or dispute in a few lines. We will tell you
          whether it belongs with this practice.
        </p>
        <a class="button" href="/contact">
          Schedule a Consultation
          <img src="/arrow-right.svg" alt="" width="14" height="14" />
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>